  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186133831,
      "id": "e34a2cbf-0bed-50eb-9e62-7c6e55560cb9",
      "title": "Constructing Line Integrals of a Vector-Valued Functions Over Plane Curves"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "5549b67c-5b9e-5463-ba35-ee996b0b1514",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/hard",
      ":question/problem": "Which ordinary definite integral represents $\\int_C \\mathbf{F}\\cdot\\mathrm{d}\\mathbf{r}$ given that $\\mathbf{F}(x,y)=(x - 2 y)\\,\\mathbf{i}+(x - y)\\,\\mathbf{j}$ and $C$ is the path $\\mathbf{r}(t)=(t \\sin{\\left(t \\right)})\\,\\mathbf{i}+(t \\cos{\\left(t \\right)})\\,\\mathbf{j}$ for $t\\in [0,2]$?\n\nUse the supplied parameterization and limits. Select the integral whose integrand is $\\mathbf{F}(\\mathbf{r}(t))\\cdot \\mathbf{r}^{\\prime}(t)$; do not evaluate it.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Use the vector line-integral formula:\n\n$$\n\\int_C \\mathbf{F}\\cdot\\mathrm{d}\\mathbf{r}=\\int_a^b \\mathbf{F}(\\mathbf{r}(t))\\cdot \\mathbf{r}^{\\prime}(t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t.\n$$\n\nSubstitute the coordinates $x=t \\sin{\\left(t \\right)}$ and $y=t \\cos{\\left(t \\right)}$ into both field components:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf{F}(\\mathbf{r}(t))&=((t \\sin{\\left(t \\right)}) - 2 (t \\cos{\\left(t \\right)}))\\,\\mathbf{i}\\\\&\\quad+((t \\sin{\\left(t \\right)}) - (t \\cos{\\left(t \\right)}))\\,\\mathbf{j}\\\\&=(t \\sin{\\left(t \\right)} - 2 t \\cos{\\left(t \\right)})\\,\\mathbf{i}\\\\&\\quad+(t \\sin{\\left(t \\right)} - t \\cos{\\left(t \\right)})\\,\\mathbf{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nDifferentiate each path component:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x^{\\prime}(t)&=\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}(t \\sin{\\left(t \\right)})=t \\cos{\\left(t \\right)} + \\sin{\\left(t \\right)},\\\\y^{\\prime}(t)&=\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}(t \\cos{\\left(t \\right)})=- t \\sin{\\left(t \\right)} + \\cos{\\left(t \\right)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiply matching components and add:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\mathbf{F}(\\mathbf{r}(t))\\cdot \\mathbf{r}^{\\prime}(t)\\\\&=(t \\sin{\\left(t \\right)} - 2 t \\cos{\\left(t \\right)})(t \\cos{\\left(t \\right)} + \\sin{\\left(t \\right)})\\\\&\\quad+(t \\sin{\\left(t \\right)} - t \\cos{\\left(t \\right)})(- t \\sin{\\left(t \\right)} + \\cos{\\left(t \\right)}).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nKeep the supplied parameter limits. The required integral is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{2}\\bigl[(t \\sin{\\left(t \\right)} - 2 t \\cos{\\left(t \\right)})(t \\cos{\\left(t \\right)} + \\sin{\\left(t \\right)})\\\\&\\quad+(t \\sin{\\left(t \\right)} - t \\cos{\\left(t \\right)})(- t \\sin{\\left(t \\right)} + \\cos{\\left(t \\right)})\\bigr]\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "f2123de2-36cf-5551-a4f2-1629c536f728",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "c5c39359-0087-508d-b376-69550b8d00ca",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{2}\\bigl[(t \\sin{\\left(t \\right)} - 2 t \\cos{\\left(t \\right)})(- t \\cos{\\left(t \\right)} + \\sin{\\left(t \\right)})\\\\&\\quad+(t \\sin{\\left(t \\right)} - t \\cos{\\left(t \\right)})(- t \\sin{\\left(t \\right)} + \\cos{\\left(t \\right)})\\bigr]\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\end{aligned}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "a39f2e37-1d71-5a83-9898-0b4009560650",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{2}\\bigl[(t \\sin{\\left(t \\right)} - 2 t \\cos{\\left(t \\right)})(- t \\cos{\\left(t \\right)} + \\sin{\\left(t \\right)})\\\\&\\quad+(- t \\sin{\\left(t \\right)} + t \\cos{\\left(t \\right)})(- t \\sin{\\left(t \\right)} + \\cos{\\left(t \\right)})\\bigr]\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\end{aligned}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "ccf95667-d20c-50fc-8ee5-bbefc34b84a2",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{2}\\bigl[(- 2 t \\sin{\\left(t \\right)} + t \\cos{\\left(t \\right)})(t \\cos{\\left(t \\right)} + \\sin{\\left(t \\right)})\\\\&\\quad+(- t \\sin{\\left(t \\right)} + t \\cos{\\left(t \\right)})(\\cos{\\left(t \\right)})\\bigr]\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\end{aligned}"
            },
